---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

---

<BaseLayout title="FAQ || Lawn Care & Pest Control Astro Theme" description="Find answers about scheduling, services, contracts, property access, billing, guarantees, weather delays, and kid- and pet-safe lawn and pest treatments." wfPage="6aba295c0e791c71047d0ee4" footerTarget="36cde689-4935-5c5d-ddd1-a3823830c2d1">
    <div class="main">
      <div class="pricing-hero-area">
        <section class="section faq-hero">
          <div class="section-gap spacer-7xl">
            <div class="w-layout-blockcontainer container w-container">
              <div class="inner-hero-header">
                <div class="hero-badge">
                  <div class="badge-dot"></div>
                  <div class="badge-text">SUPPORT</div>
                </div>
                <h1 class="inner-heading">Frequently asked questions</h1>
                <div class="pricing-hero-p-wrap">
                  <p class="hero-summary center">You can find everything you need regarding scheduling, access, safety, billing, and coverage all conveniently located in one single platform.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>
      </div>
      <section class="section">
        <div class="section-gap">
          <div class="w-layout-blockcontainer container w-container">
            <div class="faq-wrapper-main">
              <div class="faq-group">
                <div class="faq-title-wrap">
                  <div class="faq-title">Scheduling &amp; access</div>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-right">
                  <div class="faq-card">
                    <div class="faq-top-element">
                      <div class="font-normal">How do I schedule my first visit?</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="faq-p-wrapper">
                      <p class="faq-p">Submit the quote form or give us a call. Once your quote is approved, we&#x27;ll text you the next available windows to choose from.</p>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="faq-card">
                    <div class="faq-top-element">
                      <div class="font-normal">Do I need to be home for service?</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="faq-p-wrapper">
                      <p class="faq-p">No — as long as we can access the areas being treated. We send a text before we arrive and after we finish.</p>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="faq-card">
                    <div class="faq-top-element">
                      <div class="font-normal">Can I change or skip a visit?</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="faq-p-wrapper">
                      <p class="faq-p">Yes, anytime from your account or with a quick call. There are no change or skip fees.</p>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="faq-devider-line"></div>
              <div class="faq-group">
                <div class="faq-title-wrap">
                  <div class="faq-title">Safety &amp; products</div>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-right">
                  <div class="faq-card">
                    <div class="faq-top-element">
                      <div class="font-normal">Are your treatments safe for kids and pets?</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="faq-p-wrapper">
                      <p class="faq-p">Yes. We use low-toxicity, pollinator-friendly products and always provide clear re-entry times — usually once the application has dried.</p>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="faq-card">
                    <div class="faq-top-element">
                      <div class="font-normal">What products do you use?</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="faq-p-wrapper">
                      <p class="faq-p">Professional-grade, EPA-registered products selected for both effectiveness and safety around families and pets.</p>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="faq-card">
                    <div class="faq-top-element">
                      <div class="font-normal">Is your equipment really quieter?</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="faq-p-wrapper">
                      <p class="faq-p">Much quieter. Our battery-powered mowers and blowers run at a fraction of the noise of traditional gas equipment.</p>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="faq-devider-line"></div>
              <div class="faq-group">
                <div class="faq-title-wrap">
                  <div class="faq-title">Billing &amp; plans</div>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-right">
                  <div class="faq-card">
                    <div class="faq-top-element">
                      <div class="font-normal">Do you require a long-term contract?</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="faq-p-wrapper">
                      <p class="faq-p">Never. All plans are month-to-month — pause or cancel anytime with no penalty.</p>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="faq-card">
                    <div class="faq-top-element">
                      <div class="font-normal">How does billing work?</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="faq-p-wrapper max-width-34">
                      <p class="faq-p">Simple flat monthly billing, charged automatically to your card. No hidden or surprise fees.</p>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="faq-card">
                    <div class="faq-top-element">
                      <div class="font-normal">What is your satisfaction guarantee?</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="faq-p-wrapper">
                      <p class="faq-p">If you&#x27;re not happy with a visit, we&#x27;ll re-treat for free or refund it. No fine print.</p>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="faq-devider-line"></div>
              <div class="faq-group">
                <div class="faq-title-wrap">
                  <div class="faq-title">Service &amp; coverage areas</div>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-right">
                  <div class="faq-card">
                    <div class="faq-top-element">
                      <div class="font-normal">What areas do you serve?</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="faq-p-wrapper">
                      <p class="faq-p">We serve homeowners across the greater metro area. Enter your address in the quote form to instantly confirm coverage.</p>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="faq-card">
                    <div class="faq-top-element">
                      <div class="font-normal">How fast can you start?</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="faq-p-wrapper">
                      <p class="faq-p">Most new customers get their first visit within a week of approving their quote.</p>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="faq-card">
                    <div class="faq-top-element">
                      <div class="font-normal">What happens if it rains?</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="faq-p-wrapper">
                      <p class="faq-p">We automatically reschedule any weather-affected visit at no additional charge.</p>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
</BaseLayout>
